# kite-cli .envrc — optional, and only if you use direnv. kite-cli needs no
# environment variables to work. Standard install copies ~/.config/kite-cli
# cookies on auth; nothing else is read from the environment.
# If you want the estate env (keyring credentials via secretsmith),
# copy this to .envrc and point it at your estate root:
#   source_env_if_exists "$HOME/estate/.envrc"
# Otherwise omit .envrc entirely.